[13950]="7004CE42\n1\tDefeat Orc hunters (total: 10)\030Defeat Orc ambushers (total: 10)\tOrcs can be found along the Forest River, between Felegoth and Loeglond. You should defeat Orc ambushers and Orc hunters.\n2\tTalk to Lorndúr\tLorndúr can be found in Loeglond. You should talk to Lorndúr.\n",
[13951]="7002BFDE\n1\tAyuda a Céola con Jugando al escondite\030Ayuda a Twiga con Gatos salvajes de las Tierras Pardas\030Ayuda a Céola con Trolls en las Tierras Pardas\tCéola, Twiga y Dagbert se encuentra en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Céola te ha pedido que le ayudes a él y a sus tenientes, Twiga y Dagbert, con varias tareas para disminuir las amenazas en las Tierras Pardas.\n2\tHabla con Céola en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Deberías volver a ver a Céola y hacerle saber que has completado las tareas que te ha encomendado.\n",
[13952]="7006A75F\n1\tCollect meat from dun oxen east of Lond Cirion (total: 6)\030Gather vegetables and spices near the docks (total: 5)\tLornion has asked you to gather meat from dun oxen to the east as well as vegetables and spices from crates at the top of the northern lift.\n2\tBring the stew ingredients back to the tavern cook\tReturn to Lornion at The Brew and Bounty Tavern in Lond Cirion with the stew ingredients.\n3\tGet bowls from the training grounds cook\tLornion has asked that you ask Hithudor for some bowls near the training grounds behind the tavern, at the docks.\n4\tPick up the crate of bowls\tObtain a crate of bowls behind Hithudor near the training grounds at the docks.\n5\tDeliver crate of bowls to Lornion in The Brew and Bounty in Lond Cirion.\tReturn to Lornion in The Brew and Bounty in Lond Cirion.\n",
